# User-level npm config for builds that install @eleansphere/* from GitHub Packages:
# apps/api/Dockerfile (Railway) and apps/web and apps/admin on Vercel. pnpm reads registry tokens only
# from the user-level config and fills ${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN} in from the environment. Copy this file;
# never write the token into a build command — build logs print their commands.
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
